<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanqishu" book-id="b-nanqishu-040" chapter-id="c-nanqishu-040-ziqing-opening-rendered" source-id="s-nanqishu-040-current-rendered-ziqing-opening">
  <p id="c-nanqishu-040-ziqing-opening-rendered:p001" annotation-status="named_mentions_first_pass" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanqishu-040-ziqing-opening-rendered:p001:m0001" ref="kix_r92_2ed_A">廬陵王子卿</persName>字<persName id="c-nanqishu-040-ziqing-opening-rendered:p001:m0002" ref="kix_r92_2ed_A">雲長</persName>，<persName id="c-nanqishu-040-ziqing-opening-rendered:p001:m0003" ref="kix_r92_2ed">世祖</persName>第三子也。建元元年，封臨汝縣公，千五百戶。兄弟四人同封。<persName id="c-nanqishu-040-ziqing-opening-rendered:p001:m0004" ref="kix_r92_2ed">世祖</persName>卽位，為持節、都督郢州司州之義陽軍事、冠軍將軍、郢州刺史。永明元年，徙都督荊湘益寧梁南北秦七州、安西將軍、荊州刺史，持節如故。<persName id="c-nanqishu-040-ziqing-opening-rendered:p001:m0005" ref="el1_amk_djh">始興王鑑</persName>為益州，<persName id="c-nanqishu-040-ziqing-opening-rendered:p001:m0006" ref="kix_r92_2ed_A">子卿</persName>解督。</p>
</text>
